                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iVujpYs12Lzcu0QsI"><p>The Science Behind Lio</p></div
                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i7u9ffPHcwstdYzgJ"
                  ><p>Did you know: habits aren&apos;t just about substances, they&apos;re deeply connected to ritual, routine, and sensory triggers! The act of hand-to-mouth movement, deep breathing, and familiar scents play a massive role in behavioral patterns. Lio targets these triggers using <strong>olfactory conditioning</strong>, the science of how scent influences brain chemistry and behavior.</p></div
